== notes ==
* before_50_cli ran against a temporary build whose filterProperties had no LIMIT/OFFSET and built each
  row with two image queries - the 2026-09-29 read path, recreated on today's code to re-measure the
  before/after pair. It moved 1,626.9 MB of JSON in 58 s; the same plan on the current build moved 5.8 MB.
* paged_but_nplus1_50_cli and paged_nplus1_48perpage_50_cli isolate the two halves of the fix: paging alone
  already removes the regression at the page sizes the UI requests (9 and the 48-row cap).
* GUI and CLI agree at 200 users (121.3 vs 120.6 /s window throughput, 21.9 vs 25.2 ms mean).
